{%- assign dnow = "now" | date: "%a" -%}<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li>Lunch</li></ol><p class="kick">Lunch menus · week of Oct 26, 2026</p><h1>School lunch, by day</h1><p class="lede">Each tray shows the main, the vegetarian option, the sides and the major allergens in the main dish. Allergens are written out, not shown as icons.</p></div></div>
<section class="sec tight"><div class="w"><h2 style="margin-bottom:18px">Elementary and Early Learning</h2><div class="trays">{% for m in Target.Items %}{%- capture lv -%}{{ m.PublishedContent.level }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if lv == "elementary" %}{%- assign y=m.PublishedContent -%}<a class="tray {%- capture dd -%}{{ y.day }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if dd == dnow %} is-today{% endif %}" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ m.RoutePath }}"><div class="dy"><span>{{ y.day }} {{ y.date_label }}</span>{%- capture _c14 -%}{{ y.day }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if _c14 == dnow %}<span>Today</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="cp main"><small>Main</small><b>{{ y.entree }}</b></div><div class="cp"><small>Vegetarian</small>{{ y.veg }}</div><div class="cp"><small>Sides</small>{{ y.sides | replace: "|", ", " }}</div><div class="al" aria-label="Allergens">{%- assign als = y.allergens | split: "|" -%}{% for a in als %}<span>{{ a }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>{%- capture _c15 -%}{{ y.note }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if _c15 != "" %}<div class="tn">{{ y.note }}</div>{% endif %}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
<h2 style="margin:44px 0 18px">Middle and high schools</h2><div class="trays">{% for m in Target.Items %}{%- capture lv -%}{{ m.PublishedContent.level }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if lv == "secondary" %}{%- assign y=m.PublishedContent -%}<a class="tray sec2{%- capture dd -%}{{ y.day }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if dd == dnow %} is-today{% endif %}" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ m.RoutePath }}"><div class="dy"><span>{{ y.day }} {{ y.date_label }}</span>{%- capture _c16 -%}{{ y.day }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if _c16 == dnow %}<span>Today</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="cp main"><small>Main</small><b>{{ y.entree }}</b></div><div class="cp"><small>Vegetarian</small>{{ y.veg }}</div><div class="cp"><small>Sides</small>{{ y.sides | replace: "|", ", " }}</div><div class="al" aria-label="Allergens">{%- assign als = y.allergens | split: "|" -%}{% for a in als %}<span>{{ a }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>{%- capture _c17 -%}{{ y.note }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if _c17 != "" %}<div class="tn">{{ y.note }}</div>{% endif %}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
<div class="g2" style="margin-top:44px"><div class="panel"><h3>Allergies and special diets</h3><p class="muted" style="margin:0">Families of students with food allergies set up a care plan with the school nurse; see board Policy 3550 and the family resource on care plans. Nutrition services: Marisol Teague, (555) 014-1050.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Lunch accounts</h3><p class="muted" style="margin:0">Breakfast is free at every school (story). Lunch accounts are handled at each school office; there is no payment form on this example site, on purpose.</p></div></div></div></section>
